/ locals: showing_inactive
.card-body.text-center.py-5
  i.bi.bi-hourglass.text-muted.fs-1.d-block.mb-3

  - if showing_inactive
    h5.text-light.mb-2 No cooldowns on record
    p.text-muted.mb-0 Nobody has run a command here yet, so there is nothing to clear.
  - else
    h5.text-light.mb-2 Nobody is on cooldown
    p.text-muted.mx-auto.mb-0 style="max-width: 36rem;"
      | This is the normal state. Most commands are set to a couple of seconds, so their cooldowns expire faster than anyone can complain about them. What shows up here is whatever you have deliberately made long, like a usage limit on rewards.
